  "name": "Microsoft FHIR Server",
  "alternateName": [
    "FHIR Server for Azure",
    "Azure Health Data Services FHIR"
  ],
  "description": ".NET Core implementation of the HL7 FHIR standard maintained by Microsoft Healthcare. Supports FHIR R4 and R5 with pluggable persistence (SQL Server and Cosmos DB), role-based access control via Azure AAD, bulk export, and data conversion operations. Actively developed with 377 releases and CI/CD. Note: CosmosDB provider support ends September 2026. MIT licence, 1.4k stars, 583 forks, v4.0.770 (May 2026).",
