  "mach:judgement": "Assess",
  "mach:judgementReason": "Solid MIT-licensed FHIR server from Microsoft Healthcare — R4/R5 support, SQL and Cosmos DB backends, Azure AAD RBAC, bulk export. Actively maintained (v4.0.770, May 2026). Assess rather than Adopt because it is vendor-led (Microsoft), optimised for Azure infrastructure, and the CosmosDB backend is being deprecated. Teams running on Azure infrastructure with existing AAD will find this a natural fit; teams wanting cloud-neutral FHIR infrastructure should prefer HAPI FHIR.",
  "mach:editorialReviewedAt": "2026-05-28",
